Description: Kavis task manager
 Processes, Performance, Startup and Logs in one window (feedback G1:
 its own application, no longer a kavis-tools subcommand).
 .
 The process list reads /proc directly — one file per process per
 tick — and offers end task, kill, open file location and a properties
 dialog from the right-click menu. The Performance page reuses the
 hardware readers shared with Settings; Startup manages the XDG
 autostart entries; Logs is a journalctl viewer.
